1
00:00:00,024 --> 00:00:04,024
[EN] Good evening. I did not expect to find you here tonight.

2
00:00:05,592 --> 00:00:09,592
[IT] Buonasera signora, che sorpresa vederla di nuovo in questo posto

3
00:00:10,712 --> 00:00:15,336
[EN] The boat leaves at dawn. We should be ready before the sun rises.

4
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:20,760
[IT] Il mare sta notte e calmo, ma domani potrebbe cambiare tutto.

5
00:00:22,456 --> 00:00:25,736
[EN] I have waited for this moment far longer than you can imagine.

6
00:00:27,224 --> 00:00:30,760
[IT] Non ho mai visto un tramonto così bello in tutta la mia vita.

7
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,920
[EN] Tell me the truth, once and for all, before it is too late.

8
00:00:36,472 --> 00:00:40,472
[IT] Ti prometto che ritornerò prima della fine dell'estate, amore mio.
